## Version 1.4.6 (Build 6) - July 5, 2025
**First Public Release**

### 🎮 Core Features
- **Business Simulation Gameplay**: Build your production empire from the ground up
- **Material Management**: Buy raw materials at competitive prices
- **Production System**: Craft materials into valuable products
- **Sales & Profit**: Market your products for maximum profit
- **Business Growth**: Reinvest earnings to expand your operations

### 📦 Product Ecosystem
- **Basic Materials**: Cardboard, Plastic, Metals, Glass
- **Electronic Components**: Circuits, Processors, Displays, Cameras  
- **Consumer Products**: Speakers, Power Banks, Solar Panels, Smartphones
- **15+ Different Products** with unique crafting requirements and profit margins

### 💰 Strategic Elements
- Cash flow management and production timing optimization
- Dynamic pricing system for materials and products
- Progressive unlock system for advanced products
- Achievement system to track business milestones

### 🔧 Technical Features
- Optimized performance for smooth gameplay
- Local save system with persistent game progress
- Intuitive touch controls designed for mobile
- Material Design UI with game-specific theming

### 🎯 Game Highlights
- Start with simple cardboard boxes and progress to high-tech smartphones
- Balance material costs with production efficiency
- Strategic decision-making for optimal profit margins
- Engaging progression system that rewards smart business decisions

This is the inaugural release of Production.INC, offering a complete business simulation experience where players can build their industrial empire through strategic resource management and smart business decisions.